    "name": "Sky: Zenith (Leo)",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>&#9804; <strong>Leo rises Exalted today.</strong> This is the one day in two hundred and sixty. For the whole day your Techniques heighten as though you were 8 levels higher, and you have your Zenith Boon.</p><p>Your fists gain the <strong>agile</strong> trait and deal an additional @Damage[3d6[electricity]] damage.</p><p>You gain <strong>two</strong> extra actions each turn, usable only to Strike or Stride. The first is the quickened condition, applied for you. The second is a counter — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Effect: Lightning Plasma (Second Action)] — that comes back at the start of each of your turns, because pf2e keeps no pool of actions to add to.</p><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Ascendant Constellation]. A Zenith is scheduled by the GM, never rolled.</p>"
        },
